            "escalated": false,
            "lane": "review",
            "reply": "Hi Priya,\n\nSorry about the missed classes. Here's what I can tell you.\n\n1) SMS reminders: the most common reasons they stop are: no message credits left (check Settings → Billing → Message credits; reminders pause when credits run out), a client replied STOP, phone numbers missing the country code (e.g. +44 7700 900000), or the appointment was booked inside the reminder window. Reports → Reminder log shows each reminder's status (sent, failed, skipped) and the reason, which should help pinpoint the cause. If none of these explain it, reply with what the log shows and a teammate will follow up.\n\n2) Invoices: all invoices are in Settings → Billing → Invoices, where you can download PDFs. Adding your company name and VAT number under Billing details only applies to future invoices. For corrected copies of August and September, please contact the billing team; I'll pass your request along.\n\nSlotwise Support",
